   {:en
    "Wholesale and retail trade buildings that are not wholesale and retail trade shopping halls or shopping centres, shops and department stores. \n\nOther wholesale and retail trade buildings include public saunas, spas, solariums, dry cleaners, unmanned filling stations and permanent kiosks built in place.",
