   {:en
    "Buildings for institutional care where medically justified health care services or medical treatment are provided or sick animals are treated. \n\nHealth care buildings include health care and wellness centres, central hospitals, special hospitals and laboratory buildings, other hospitals, rehabilitation institutions and other health care buildings.",
