  {:description
   {:en
    "Mining and quarrying buildings that are intended for the processing of other raw materials than metal ores.\n\nFor example, oil, gas, stone, sand, gravel, clay, fertiliser minerals, precious stones and salt can be processed in other mining and quarrying buildings.",
    :fi
